             (agent-core develop), which the FEAT-056 verification demo already targets; both sides
             of FEAT-056 must describe one product revision. 0.1.17 removed
             com.openjiuwen.core.session.Session (BaseAgent.invoke/stream now take AgentSessionApi)
             and the ToolCallInputs builder, so the white-box probes were migrated with the bump. -->
